sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as High: Task_Process (Prio 3)
    participant M as Medium: Task_Compute (Prio 2)
    participant L as Low: Task_Health (Prio 1)
    participant S as Shared Resource (g_diag_resource)

    Note over H,S: RUN A: Binary Semaphore Control (No Priority Inheritance)
    L->>S: xSemaphoreTake(g_diag_sem) [Low acquires lock]
    L->>H: xTaskNotifyGive(High) & xTaskAbortDelay
    Note over H: High awakens, starts DWT sample
    H->>S: xSemaphoreTake(g_diag_sem) -> BLOCKS
    Note over L: Context returns to Low
    L->>M: xTaskNotifyGive(Medium) [Deterministic Block Opportunity Passed]
    Note over M: Medium awakens (Prio 2 > 1) -> PREEMPTS Low!
    M-->>M: Executes ~20 ms CPU Interference Workload
    Note over L: Medium finishes; Low resumes execution
    L-->>L: Executes ~5 ms CPU Critical Workload
    L->>S: xSemaphoreGive(g_diag_sem) [Low releases lock]
    Note over H: High unblocks! DWT delta recorded (~25 ms)
    H->>S: xSemaphoreGive(g_diag_sem)

    Note over H,S: RUN B: Mutex Comparison (Priority Inheritance Active)
    L->>S: xSemaphoreTake(g_diag_mutex) [Low acquires mutex]
    L->>H: xTaskNotifyGive(High) & xTaskAbortDelay
    Note over H: High awakens, starts DWT sample
    H->>S: xSemaphoreTake(g_diag_mutex) -> BLOCKS
    Note over L: Low inherits Priority 3 from High!
    L->>M: xTaskNotifyGive(Medium)
    Note over M: Medium awakens at Prio 2 (Cannot preempt inherited Prio 3 Low!)
    L-->>L: Executes ~5 ms CPU Critical Workload Immediately
    L->>S: xSemaphoreGive(g_diag_mutex) [Low disinherits to Prio 1]
    Note over H: High unblocks! DWT delta recorded (~5 ms)
    H->>S: xSemaphoreGive(g_diag_mutex)
    Note over M: Medium finally runs interference workload after High yields
